DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Chicago Public Library\\nCost: free\\nAges: 0-60 mo
 nths\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nThe Kelly Kouture Community Closet offers 
 free\, gently used clothing to anyone in need. Items are available on a fi
 rst-come\, first-served basis\, with a rotating selection that is restocke
 d regularly. Donations of free\, gently used clothing can be dropped off o
 n the 2nd Friday of each month from 12 to 2 p.m. This initiative is part o
 f our commitment to supporting our community's immediate needs while creat
 ing a welcoming and accessible library space for all. No registration is r
 equired. Visitors \\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com/eve
 nts/6a67a44ce9de6536001e9bce
